CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'priv->old_speed != phydev->speed'
#358: FILE: drivers/net/ethernet/arc/arc_emac_main.c:153:
+	if (phydev->link && (priv->old_speed != phydev->speed)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

